@startuml sequence-diagram-UC-001
title Sequence UC-001 Autenticarse — FR-001/FR-002/FR-003 / BR-002/BR-003 / NFR-003
actor Actor
participant "AuthController\n(Adapter)" as Ctrl
participant "RegisterUserUseCase\n/ LoginUseCase\n(Controller)" as UC
participant "ValidatorPort\n(Pure Fabrication)" as Val
participant "PasswordHasher\n(port)" as Hash
participant "User\n(Entity)" as Ent
participant "UserRepository\n(port)" as Repo
participant "TokenSigner\n(port)" as Sign
participant "AuthSession\n(Value Object)" as Sess
database MariaDB as DB

Actor -> Ctrl : POST /auth/register|/login {email, password}
' GRASP Controller — Mission: single entry point per system operation, UI stays thin
Ctrl -> UC : execute(dto)
' GRASP Pure Fabrication — Mission: protect domain cohesion; reglas BR-003 fuera de User
UC -> Val : validateEmail + validatePassword (BR-003)
Val --> UC : ok / 400
' GRASP Creator — Mission: one stable owner per lifecycle, no scattered new
UC -> Ent : User.create({email, passwordHash, role, tokenVersion}) [registro]
' GRASP Indirection — Mission: both sides depend on something stable
UC -> Hash : hash(password) [BCrypt cost>=10, NFR-003]
Hash --> UC : passwordHash
UC -> Repo : findByEmail(email) [unicidad BR-003 -> 409]
Repo -> DB : SELECT users (RST-004)
DB --> Repo : row / none
Repo --> UC : User / null
UC -> Repo : save(user)
Repo -> DB : INSERT users (token_version=0)
DB --> Repo : id
Repo --> UC : User

Actor -> Ctrl : (login) {email, password}
Ctrl -> UC : LoginUseCase.execute(dto)
UC -> Val : validateEmail
UC -> Repo : findByEmail(email) [CARGA PRIMERO el User que aporta el hash]
Repo --> UC : User / null (-> 401 genérico)
' GRASP Indirection — Mission: both sides depend on something stable
UC -> Hash : compare(password, user.passwordHash) [orden corregido, BT-05 §2]
Hash --> UC : ok / 401
' GRASP Information Expert — Mission: co-locate behavior with information (userId, role, ver)
UC -> Sign : sign({userId, role, ver: user.tokenVersion}) [JWT <=24h, NFR-003]
Sign --> UC : JWT
UC -> Sess : AuthSession(token,userId,role,expiresAt) [transitorio, NO persistido]
UC --> Ctrl : AuthResult (nunca password, NFR-004)
Ctrl --> Actor : 201/200 con JWT

note over Ctrl, UC : Clean 4: Frameworks/Adapters -> UseCases -> Entities/Ports (solo hacia adentro)
note over Repo, Sess : Crypto tras puertos (BcryptHasher/JwtTokenSigner en Frameworks): Entities sin imports framework (BT-06 §2)
@enduml
